ac-toe prints a compact text board labeled A-C and 1-3 and asks Your move? with nine coordinate choices initially and only empty squares thereafter. User plays X first; Hal plays O; detect win and draw, allow Escape to leave, and make replay deterministic and validate recorded moves rather than trusting arbitrary answers.',
